@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://confOf#Administrator> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Organizator> .

<http://confOf#Author> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Author> .

<http://confOf#Company> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee_member> .

<http://confOf#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://confOf#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://confOf#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Person> .

<http://confOf#Science_Worker> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Listener> .

<http://confOf#University> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee_member> .

<http://confOf#Volunteer> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Listener> .

<http://confOf#abstract> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Abstract> .

